Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm on my own, I've\Nyet to reach the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So won't you come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, soon the rain\Nwill be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the\Nanchor, now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm the storm\Nthat you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have my board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up,\Nwe set self cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh enough, stand tall and\Ntake a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme wanna see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't all of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Edgy? Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the sound that\NRace makes when he runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another one of his many skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ninpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindfolding technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kanjado, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one else behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you trickster, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:02:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that thing, and why the\Nheck was it falling out of the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At first glance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it looked like a wounded man covered\Nin blood and riddled with knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a little monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have led with the\Nless gruesome one, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something back. Are you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something back—did they hit the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's save them, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy, not to worry—we are both unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,On, thank goodness—they're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go on ahead—we'll reunite both!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no way—is he crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's turn around the\Ndragon—we need to go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Down—no other way! Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,turn around—he seems like he
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,wants to finish what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:04:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,he
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,started!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what he's\Nsuffering—the better press on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,what he's suffering the\Nbetter press on so cute
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're going on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see you guys there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A valiant choice! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not welcome in\Nthat country! Proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever that other guy is, he's not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, Ryunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, we're so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the home stretch now, big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sprint to the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A few more steps and we're there! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Reunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong, Reunosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Reunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Reunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Reunosuke! Reunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Reunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eee?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally reached the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Reunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on phone! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, you're changing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryunosuke! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a crappy drawing show.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Some respect, you jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can at least thank him\Nfor bringing you all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know this place well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, you're not wrong? but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp, Ryunosuke was great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Never stop looking ahead. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be the gate to the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess there really is a civilization\Non this elephant's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a watchtower, but no guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems suspiciously undermanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Old business, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you guys get over our\Nfriend's death so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, get up here real quick\NWe can check out the view!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easier said than done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that hard work, we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it to ZO!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this real?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we're up here, it's\Njust like any other country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole thing is totally crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe that elephant's\Na thousand years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's explore. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a blast. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a forest and a\Nriver and a town, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it goes on as far\Nas the eye can see. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That tree is shaped like a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That town is bigger than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's something\Noff about it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there he goes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You see curly brows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, I'm too high up to see anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, should we wait\Nhere for the other two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, this place isn't that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd he jump the gates wide open?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how I'd describe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was destroyed by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,See, they plowed right through
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the trail too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No normal animal could\Nhave made a path this wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some next-level destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still fresh, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope Sanji's group's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't look like this\Nfrom the watchtower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have made this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.18,0:09:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even met the people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already got some\Nmonster to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys would listen to me once in\Na while and run away from the bad stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,our lives would be a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hard to walk on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's elephant skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers here grow in odd places.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Part?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The lesser minks waltz\Nright through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this feels so weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really soft under your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons of buildings,\Nbut I don't see anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.34,0:10:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are all the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, Nami, Chopper, Brock, Momo,\Nare any of you guys around? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, answer me! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops, I forgot the gas guy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that gunpowder I'm smelling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.78,0:10:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and a little bit of gas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,More trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just go to a peaceful\Nisland once in a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what's up? What'd you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She just jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about them! We must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The whale forest has been invaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a mink tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know those clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, what the hell is that weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing gave me a serious shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an invader in the Will Force, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the situation is dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guardians are not going\Nto be happy about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of dog? Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you better tell us where you got that\Noutfit because it doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do, Nutanami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're cannibals? Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm double scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't eat me, nice lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, talk about air!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, do all of these mink\Npeople have skills like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,See anything unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope we're not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the whale forest on\Nthe other side of Karoo City!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Warnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to transport you, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you should head to the west,\Nby way of the right-trump forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, if you turn left at the\Nswamp, you'll reach right flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you'll\Nfind your cruise corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us in right flank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch up to you shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That group was the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in for a real shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to\Ndeal with them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is far more urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the rest of the crew\Nhas finally showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume that the invader in the\NWhale Forest is Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And while he may be their captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the Guardians won't show him any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of the crew is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:14:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she did say that there was a\Ncorpse, which means they weren't eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so morbid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Curly Browse is with them, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Zorro's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they would\Ngo down that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those animal ladies must be\Ntrying to trick us somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably so, but what a terrible lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, the rest of your crewmates,\Nthey should be here, correct? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And can you contact them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even really expect\NI would see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a Vever card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for our navigator, Beppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, the talking polar bear, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he's a mink, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this place is where he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,he left the island when\Nhe was a little boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,so he doesn't remember much about living\Nhere or being part of the mink tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known him for a whole decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want reliable info, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's a town that way, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember seeing it from the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who knows what we'll run into?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We might see some cannibals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than trusting\Nwhat that dog lady said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugolaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His Electro isn't working at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop attacking him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, he's somebody I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's still an intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If he won't stop, then I'm\Nafraid I'll have to force you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...out of our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Parshat Bart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can handle this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, he's way too tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Donnie, stop this! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yutia must be Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Wanda,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do you no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is full of talking animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a whole island full of choppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with these two?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They came and jumped me for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because your kind is\Nforbidden to enter this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardians, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, for Wanda's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat, Roddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.48,0:17:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even notice they were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Be grateful Yutia didn't encounter\Nthem on a moonlit night. Strawhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you look so confused?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We took care of you after what\Nhappened back in Marineford!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you forget that? Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the talking bear who was\Npart of Traffy's crew, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Traffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, our captain is the\Ngenius surgeon Trafalgar Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the heart pirates, okay? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we've kept up with the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So much has been happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're allies now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is our captain here? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeffy's here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep saying that name!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that? Aye-aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I call law.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever, I'm just glad\Nto hear he's on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait to\Nsee our captain again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This city was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by the size, the population\Ncould be in the hundreds of thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't see a single resident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay out here in the open,\Nthey'll come and get us for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably still\Naround here, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta run for cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.32,0:19:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of torture device?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of hard to say whether we're dealing\Nwith humans or something else here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but they're\Nall over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be something pretty\Nstrong to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's some kind of footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:19:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Another elephant, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everything's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There were claw marks, so it\Ncould have been infighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We do know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This place fell, but it\Nhasn't been that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Two weeks, maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then this city got\Nwrecked while our friends were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why there's nobody around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The country's history\Ngoes back for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called the Mokumo Dukedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only half a month ago that I\Ncould still see everyone's smiling faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of the man who caused\Nall this suffering is Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this something bad?\NHooray! Invasion is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a lorny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll head to right flank!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Sanji's group, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
